"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-07T07:29:48-07:00","id":1310530,"title":"","content":"I have been reading about the World of Darkness for somewhere around six years now and I only understand like 50% of the terms being used right now.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23725-hardestadttheevenyounger","name":"HardestadtTheEvenYounger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23725_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"286"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}